  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></math>, for all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>20</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to ______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3395",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>&amp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Integrating, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math>&nbsp;but&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp; as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now comparing equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn><mfenced><mn>21</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mn>41</mn></mfenced></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn><mfenced><mn>21</mn></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2870</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>525</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3395</mn></math></p>",
